		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Friends Request Page|
		|siteName|test|
	And AssertClick the value 'ADD AS FRIEND' at locator '//div[@class='add-as-friend']/button[contains(.,'Add as Friend')]'
